   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Ms. Castor (FL) moved to recommit to the Committee on Natural Resources. (text: CR H2813-2814)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2024-05-01",
   "actionTime": "16:06:42",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H.Res. 1173, the House proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Stauber amendment No. 1.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2024-05-01",
   "actionTime": "15:03:45",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with one hour of debate on H.R. 6285.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2024-05-01",
   "actionTime": "15:02:06",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 615, H.R. 2925, H.R. 3195, H.R. 764, H.R. 3397, H.R. 6285 and H.R. 6090. The rule provides for consideration of H.R. 615, H.R. 2925, H.R. 3195, H.R. 764, H.R. 3397, and H.R. 6090 under a closed rule, and H.R. 6285 under a structured rule. The rule provides for one hour of general debate and one motion to recommit on each bill.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "2024-05-01",
   "actionTime": "15:02:01",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 1173. (consideration: CR H2804-2814)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H1L210",
   "actionDate": "2024-04-29",
   "actionTime": "20:25:01",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 1173 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 615, H.R. 2925, H.R. 3195, H.R. 764, H.R. 3397, H.R. 6285 and H.R. 6090. The rule provides for consideration of H.R. 615, H.R. 2925, H.R. 3195, H.R. 764, H.R. 3397, and H.R. 6090 under a closed rule, and H.R. 6285 under a structured rule. The rule provides for one hour of general debate and one motion to recommit on each bill.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
